{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and casual elimination game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939330/extras/e5998ef48a00a599a7e41e9ded7d5c43.avif?t=1757958294\" width=920 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Zuma gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls will gradually roll into the hole. Players can click the left mouse button to fire cannonballs. When three cannonballs of the same color connect, the beads will be eliminated. Once all beads are eliminated, the level is won!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 10 levels of different difficulty waiting for players to challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, various limited-time special beads will appear randomly, and the special beads have various skill effects.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939330?t=1757958294","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939330?t=1757958294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939330/9a3acaeb702b797dfd6119a56862b00f44464c64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757958294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939330/9a3acaeb702b797dfd6119a56862b00f44464c64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757958294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and casual elimination game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939330/extra